<title>GERMANY: Kugelfischer to build plant in China.</title>
<headline>Kugelfischer to build plant in China.</headline>
<dateline>SCHWEINFURT, Germany 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German ball-bearing maker FAG Kugelfischer AG said on Wednesday it would build a plant near Shanghai to supply auto manufacturers in Asia.</p>
<p>Kugelfischer will invest 10 million marks in the plant, its first in China, which will employ 150 workers and produce five million ball bearings a year. The company had previously supplied the same customers from plants in Germany and Brazil.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said no job cuts were planned at the German and Brazilian plants.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
